        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PBB CB214540625NRP:  4-1/2 x 4  Polished Chrome Brass Hinge, Non-Removable Pin</b>\r\n<p>Concealed bearing 3 knuckle design hinge made from solid brass with a <b>Polished Chrome</b> finish. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSecure Non-Removable Pin for exterior outswing doors, prevents the hinge pins removal by vandals and thieves.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E11LE1_size.gif?v=1704442261\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"PBB CB214540625NRP Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Removable Pin</b> for Security</li>\r\n<li>US26 <b>Polished Chrome</b> Finish</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Hinge Pin</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws and 12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** These hinges are Special order please allow 16 weeks to ship. \r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
